          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I see customer reviews?",
            "answer": "<p>We've shipped 20,000+ packages over the last 2 years. But we can understand if it's your first time ordering and you're hesitant!</p><p>We're just starting off with Vescartes but to view feedback from our main brands, you can check the hundreds of tagged pictures on our IG pages (@caedeslondon & @kenshin.kollection).</p>"
