          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "",
            "heading_alignment": "left",
            "underline_heading": false,
            "text": "<h4>Defective or Incorrect Items</h4><p>We will replace your item at no additional cost or offer full store credit if:</p><ul><li>You recieve a majorly defective item (e.g tears, rips, large stains)</li><li>You recieve the wrong size or an incorrect item.</li></ul><p>If the style is in stock, a replacement will be sent. If the style is unavailable you may keep the item and a full store credit will be issued.</p><p>Minor imperfections - such as loose stitches, slight wash variations or faint marks - are considered part of the production process and are not classified as major defects</p>",
            "text_alignment": "left",
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "heading_size_desktop": 32,
            "heading_size_mobile": 24,
            "text_size_desktop": 16,
            "text_size_mobile": 14,
            "padding_top_desktop": 0,
