            "heading_alignment": "left",
            "underline_heading": false,
            "text": "<h4>Returns for Sizing</h4><p>We accept returns for sizing related issues.</p><ul><li>Return shipping for sizing returns is the responsibility of the customer</li><li>All sizing returns must be sent using tracked delivery</li><li>Refunds are processed only once the parcel is confirmed as delivered.</li><li>Size charts allow a 5% measurement leniency due to slight production variations.</li><li>Size recommendations from our team or Size Finder are provided as guidance only. Individual fit preferences may vary, and final size selection remains the customer’s responsibility.</li></ul>",
